## Description

Do not hire list, candidate blacklist, flagged by employer. The "Do-Not-Hire List" is real, and it is not an industry conspiracy or recruiters coordinating against specific candidates. It is something far more specific, and far more fixable. A corporate recruiter with 20+ years at Amazon, FedEx, and Korn Ferry breaks down what actually gets candidates flagged inside hiring systems, what the myth gets wrong, and what to do about it.

If you have been applying and not hearing back, or getting rejected faster than a human could have read your application, there is a real chance something inside a hiring system is working against you. This video explains exactly how that happens and what triggers it.
